// Import-then-reexport (rather than `export { X } from "./mod"` or
// `export * from "./mod"`) so tsc's CommonJS output uses plain
// `exports.X = value` assignments. Bundlers that statically analyze this
// package's compiled output (Vite/Rollup on the frontend) can see those;
// they cannot reliably see the getter-based re-exports `export { X } from`
// produces, nor the dynamic `__exportStar` a wildcard re-export produces.

